<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Frontier Insurance.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Frontier Insurance.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Stephens Inc said it cut Frontier Insurance Group Inc to buy from strong buy based on share appreciation.</p>
<p>-- said long-term prospects for Frontier remain very favorable.</p>
<p>-- Frontier lost 5/8 to 49.</p>
</text>
